<name><surname>Boerman</surname><given-names>OC</given-names></name><name><surname>Koppe</surname><given-names>MJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Postema</surname><given-names>EJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Corstens</surname><given-names>FH</given-names></name><name><surname>Oyen</surname><given-names>WJ</given-names></name></person-group><year>2007</year><article-title>Radionuclide therapy of cancer with radiolabeled antibodies.</article-title><source>Anticancer Agents Med. Chem.</source><volume>7</volume><fpage>335</fpage><lpage>343</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17504159</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000964-Wu1"><label>21</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Wu</surname><given-names>AM</given-names></name><name><surname>Senter</surname><given-names>PD</given-names></name></person-group><year>2005</year><article-title>Arming antibodies: prospects and challenges for immunoconjugates.</article-title><source>Nat. Biotech.</source><volume>23</volume><fpage>1137</fpage><lpage>1146</lpage></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000964-Okarvi1"><label>22</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Okarvi</surname><given-names>SM</given-names></name></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Peptide-based radiopharmaceuticals: Future tools for diagnostic imaging of cancers and other diseases.</article-title><source>Med. Res. Rev.</source><volume>24</volume><fpage>357</fpage><lpage>397</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">14994368</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="pone.0000964-Aina1"><label>23</label><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Aina</surname><given-names>OH</given-names></name><name><surname>Sroka</surname><given-names>TC</given-names></name><name><surname>Chen</surname><given-names>ML</given-names></name><name><surname>Lam</surname><given-names>KS</given-names></name></person-group><y